## Production node. Distribution listens on loopback only and the cookie comes
## from the BRISKD_COOKIE environment variable (relx substitutes ${...} at start).
## The host is localhost: distribution listens on 127.0.0.1 only, and a
## container's own hostname resolves to its external address, where nothing
## listens, so `briskd ping`, `eval`, and `remote_console` could not connect.
-sname briskd@localhost
-setcookie ${BRISKD_COOKIE}
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface {127,0,0,1}
